Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 07:46:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 271/307] !B (Terrain Plate) Sample plate colour from the
 material diffuse texture.

Sample the plate material's diffuse texture, UV transform and colour multiplier
for live and permanent terrain colour. Select a suitable CPU mip and handle
sRGB conversion consistently; skip materials without readable diffuse data.
